// 003.7, 005.4 (D32): reading an unset `Var` in an effect halts with missing input (CHR100)
// rather than silently dropping the effect. Ordinary `Fact` reads over zero instances still
// produce nothing, and `Terminates v` on an unset `Var` still clears cleanly.
//! expect-error: CHR100
Fact p Identified by A
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Fact bid Identified by p * usd
Var paid Identified by usd
Act clear-all Actor p Holds when True Terminates paid, bid When bid.p == p
Act pay Actor p Related to usd Holds when True Creates paid(paid.usd + usd)
.
clear-all(A).
pay(A, 500).
